-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON THE 7-ZIP INTEGRATION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This product can optionally invoke a 7-Zip executable already installed on the
user system to read archive formats that have no pure-Python implementation.
7-Zip is a separate work licensed under LGPL-2.1-or-later and BSD-3-Clause.

The RAR decoding portion of 7-Zip derives from the unRAR source code, whose
license permits extraction of RAR archives ONLY and forbids the creation of a
RAR compression algorithm. ZipFlow accordingly supports reading RAR but never
writing RAR archives.

See resources/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt for the full list of third-party
components and their licenses.
